{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、枕を変えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが、ななんとオーダーメイド枕\nなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーダーメイドってなんか\n響きいいよね。大人な感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと枕が欲しくて、\nラジオで言ったり\nＮＯＧＩＢＩＮＧＯの46万円企画の\nアンケートに書いたりしていたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな縁が重なり\nようやく手に入れました☆〜（ゝ。∂）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの枕は\n１０歳くらいから使っている\n母とお揃いの枕だったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗濯を繰り返しているうちに\n元気がなくなってきていて・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(なんなら母はかなり前から\nすでに違う枕になってた)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ようやく自分に合った枕で\n睡眠を行えるようになりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜快適快適♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＯＬとアイドルをやっていると\nどうしても睡眠時間が\n思うようにとれないので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを機に睡眠の質を\nあげられたらいいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しいそこのあなた！\nオーダーメイド枕、おススメです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもいい快眠法があったら\n是非教えてくださいね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月9日　ＵＴＢ＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川さんとのペアグラビア\n本日発売です(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェでのほっこりショットから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラックの衣装に赤いルージュを塗った\n大人目ショットまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん載せて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回はなんと裏表紙まで...！！\n本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しさが伝わって\n心が温かくなってくれたら\n嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非お手に取ってみて下さいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の放送出てました♪\n見てくれた方いますかね〜〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は松村さんのプレゼンで\n匂いフェチ大会？をしたんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はエレベーターの中の匂いが\n好きと答えたのですが\n共感できた方はいますかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかわからないのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エレベーターの中のあの\n独特の匂いが大好きなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンション\nスーパーマーケット\n百貨店\nビル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれ匂いが全然違うんですけど\n違う良さがあるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも変わった匂いだと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファミリーパックの\n箱アイスの冷たい匂い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コインランドリーのにおい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プールのにおい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも人には理解されないけど\n好きな匂いってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジオで見ての通り\n割と盛り上がるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度握手会でお話ししましょーね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\nいい匂いももちろん好きなんで\n悪しからず！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて！\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は週の真ん中、水曜日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということは\nまいちゅんカフェのOPEN日ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し夜更かしをしてもいいよーって方は\n24:00〜bayFMで待っています♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！また書きます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/12/10/7343555/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜は何を飲むかな〜〜？"}],"source":"archive"}